project_text: "FIRST SIGHTS is a flash art project by Daphne Sander and Odysseus Stamoglou. Together, the two artists go to different locations – from cafés to concerts to resorts – and create sketches of what they see around them. Odysseus sketches in ink drawings, Daphne does in words. The resulting art pieces, created on the spot, combine these two voices. The art thus creates something that in real life, we can only dream of: one memory, by two people.



If you think that our duo could work well at your private or public event, or if you are interested in a collaboration, please reach out to us through: mail@daphnesander.com.


For inquiries regarding acquisition of originals or prints, also write to us at: mail@daphnesander.com."
