artist_left_text: "Odysseus Stamoglou, is a painter, musician and performer, born in Greece. Since 2008, his designs and illustrations have been published worldwide, featuring on award-winning board games, books, covers, video games, films, traditional and digital paintings. Odysseus composes music, plays several instruments, leads, organizes and performs in  public events, gives workshops on drawing and visual communication, and cooperates with individuals and teams from around the globe."
artist_right_text: "Daphne Sander is a script writer from Tübingen, Germany. Her plays and films move mostly in the world of serious drama, though her dialogue has been described as screwballishly clever. She studied literature, cognitive linguistics, philosophy and classics at the University of Tübingen. Sander began working her first professional film jobs while still at university, after cold-emailing her original scripts to production companies. She continues to pursue and share her love of literature, for example in her youth theater project ZEITECHT."
